			"• まだ誰も見つけていない新しいレシピを開発しよう！",
			"• ピカちん大百科に綴じられるピカちんシートも付いてくるぞ！"
		],
		"en": [
			"• A great product that can be used to make anything into furikake!",
			"• The furikake maker that appears on the TV program \"Pochitto Invention Pikachin Kit\" has been commercialized!",
			"• The furikake maker is an invention that allows you to make your own original furikake by crushing sweets!",
			"• Develop new recipes that no one has found yet!",
			"• It also comes with a Pikachin sheet that can be bound into the Pikachin Encyclopedia!"
